OL,3,GNEWSAThe therapy dogs bringing a
OL,4,Acalming presence to children
OL,5,
OL,6,FClodagh always dreaded her hospital
OL,7,Fappointments.
OL,9,FSince the age of two she struggled due
OL,10,Fto her anxiety when visiting a cold and
OL,11,Fsterile environment.
OL,13,FIt took a friendly, furry face to bring
OL,14,Fher calmness.
OL,16,FNow, Clodagh is excited to attend
OL,17,Fbecause it means she can spend time
OL,18,Fwith her new canine friend Mia, one of
OL,19,Fseveral therapy dogs helping children
OL,20,Fwith medical appointments and school.
